      "tag": "section",
      "heading": "EST. VALUE",
      "text": "Captured Lead\n1\nSAM.gov Solicitations\nForecast\nZ--MICC - Fort Hood is issuing a PRE-SOLICITATION NOTICE for an Invitation for Bids\n\nPre-solicitation notice for technical support, engineering services, sustainment and program support requirements.\n\n Agency:\n\nDEPT OF DEFENSE\n\n Location:\n\nTX\n\nEST. VALUE\n\nTBD (Research)\n\nTARGET SET-ASIDE\n\nSBA Certified Economically Disadvantaged\n\nNAICS CODE\n\n238220\n\nNOTICE ID\n\n71A3869E38F94B0FE70BB3562A642\n\n Responses Due: Sep 8, 2026\nDetails \nQualifications\n1\nSAM.gov Solicitations\nForecast\nY--526-15-1-636-0071 - Replace waste drain pipe Bronx\n\nReplacement of waste drain pipe and associated infrastructure work including construction and technical support.\n\n Agency:\n\nDEPT OF DEFENSE\n\n Location:\n\nNY\n\nEST. VALUE\n\nTBD (Research)\n\nTARGET SET-ASIDE\n\nService-Disabled Veteran-Owned Small Business\n\nNAICS CODE\n\n236220\n\nNOTICE ID\n\n6AF9EC5D24ED50DDA3F956DF57FF8FE4\n\n Responses Due: Jan 25, 2027\nDetails \nWrite & Submit Proposal\n1\nRecompete\nIDV_B_B\nUS Mint Headquarters-INDEFINITE DELIVERY / INDEFINITE QUANTITY-FY2010\n\nMint Mac Gold Bullion: Provide Raw Gold Material.\n\n Agency:\n\nDepartment of the Treasury\n\nIncumbent: A-Mark Precious Metals, Inc.\nEST. VALUE\n\n$10B+\n\nPREV SET-ASIDE\n\nNo Set Aside\n\nNAICS CODE\n\n331491\n\nAWARD ID (PIID)\n\nTMHQ10C0040\n\nLEAD SOURCE\n\nNot Available\n\n Expires: Dec 31, 2026\nDetails \nSubmitted Status\n1\nSAM.gov Solicitations\nRFI\nSynchronized Persistent Army Experimentation (SPARX)\n\nSPECIAL NOTICE AMENDMENT updated to change AFC to T2COM and add a note about not including proprietary information.\n\n Agency:\n\nDEPT OF DEFENSE\n\n Location:\n\nMD\n\nEST. VALUE\n\nTBD (Research)\n\nTARGET SET-ASIDE\n\nEvaluating\n\nNAICS CODE\n\n5417\n\nNOTICE ID\n\n46144B33CCAA476B8D55EBAA57AF1\n\n Responses Due: Oct 18, 2026\nDetails",
      "id": "",
      "className": "gray_bg",
      "ariaLabel": null,
      "role": null
    }
